Notes

* Status

Embedded -- works.
Socket -- works.
OpenBSD kernel driver -- not implemented
Linux kernel driver -- implemented for Linux 2.0.18, 2.2.18 and
	possibly 2.4.2 -- untested if these ever worked.  There is
	also a completely untested version for Linux 4.11.3.

* Bugs

* History

Files marked with an asterix (*) are currently used.  Files marked
with (+) have been added, but not used by anything.  Files marked with
(-) have been removed.

